=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_f3a1 — Priya's Standard Morning; the Mat Stays Rolled (fork of p_c9d4)

The yoga-mat claim in p_c9d4 was refuted: on both sighted days yoga_mat_priya was found at wardrobe_b2 and never at floor_l_l1. This fork removes the 06:00–06:45 floor block and the 06:45–07:00 transition block entirely; the mat stays rolled in wardrobe_b2 all day, every day. Priya's routine is otherwise unchanged: morning walk 07:30–09:00 (weekday) or 10:00–12:00 (weekend), afternoon errands 14:00–16:00 (weekday). Hana is home until 13:40, out until 23:00 on weekdays. The guitar stays in Hana's bedroom; the camera stays on the bookshelf.

A second correction: the per-object evidence shows shoes_priya is consistently at entry_floor_e1 (2/2 sighted days), not shoe_rack_e1 as p_c9d4 assumed. This fork moves the base block to entry_floor_e1.

What sets this apart from p_c9d4: the yoga mat never leaves wardrobe_b2 (no 06:00 floor block); shoes_priya rests at entry_floor_e1. What sets this apart from p_a3f7: the morning walk window is 07:30–09:00 (not 07:00–09:00), mug_priya's breakfast window starts at 06:45 (not 06:30), and the cutting board rests at counter_k1 (not a separate 12-13/17-19 counter block). What would refute it: yoga_mat_priya sighted at floor_l_l1 at any hour; shoes_priya sighted at shoe_rack_e1.

